# Lockfiles — bun.lock is the ONE lockfile this repo tracks.
# npm prunes other platforms' optional binaries out of package-lock.json (npm/cli#4828),
# so a lockfile written on macOS carries only the darwin-arm64 rollup and esbuild builds
# and `npm ci` on the linux build box dies with
# "Cannot find module @rollup/rollup-linux-x64-gnu". Keeping it untracked is what makes
# Cloudflare install with bun, which resolves the binaries for the platform it is on.
# This was fixed once in 4b4a03a and silently undone when 846de4b re-added the file.
package-lock.json

